                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="o1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#0e6b5c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=17;" value="&lt;b&gt;Response → routes/clinical.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;JSON: shunt_type, confidence, findings, ligation_steps, conversational_response&lt;br&gt;saved via chat_db.py, returned to index.html" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="460" x="170" y="615" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="o2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#5b3fa6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=17;" value="&lt;b&gt;Response → routes/general.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;JSON: conversational_response, context_count&lt;br&gt;saved via chat_db.py, returned to general.html" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="460" x="720" y="620" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=#999999;rounded=0;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=17;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes (not drawn as tiers)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• LLM: every agent calls Groq (openai/gpt-oss-120b) through the CrewAI/litellm wrapper in crew_agents.py (_make_llm()).&lt;br&gt;• Database: both routes read/write the same SQLite store via chat_db.py (sessions, messages, feedback, users).&lt;br&gt;• Core logic: crew_pipeline.py sits between routes and agents. Clinical functions (parse_nl_to_clips, build_conversational_response, classify_and_plan_ligation_with_llm, run_pipeline) are called only by routes/clinical.py; generate_general_response() only by routes/general.py.&lt;br&gt;• services.call_llm() and services.groq_client are unused (dead code).&lt;br&gt;• services.init_services() runs once at startup and injects the shared Qdrant client into both rag_engine.py and general_chat_engine.py (arrow labelled &#39;startup&#39;). That is the only link between services.py and General Chat; at request time General Chat never calls services.py." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="220" width="950" x="170" y="730" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
